title: "PHIL 2001 Replicator Dynamics Explorer"
abstract: "Phase-portrait and basin explorer for evolutionary game dynamics (replicator and related dynamics in one and two populations, assortment, Monte-Carlo basins); a teaching tool for PHIL 2001, Ethics and Evolutionary Games, at Northeastern University."
